        "execSummary":  "NVLink Fusion signals that NVIDIA is pivoting from pure GPU vendor to AI infrastructure platform ΓÇö allowing custom silicon players to plug into NVIDIA\u0027s ecosystem rather than compete with it head-on. For enterprise leaders, this matters because it shapes the future supplier landscape: companies building custom AI chips (hyperscalers, specialized AI providers) are more likely to build on NVIDIA interconnects than replace them, which consolidates NVIDIA\u0027s position across the AI stack. From an enterprise procurement standpoint, this reduces the risk that custom-silicon alternatives will disrupt NVIDIA\u0027s ecosystem in the medium term. The key watch item is whether this strategy accelerates or delays the availability of credible non-NVIDIA AI infrastructure alternatives for enterprises seeking to diversify supply chains.",
