        "summary":  "Cheshire Academy in Connecticut has implemented a tiered traffic light system to govern student AI use ΓÇö green for full access, yellow for specific permitted tools, and red for AI-free work ΓÇö while training educators on both AI techniques and limitations. Teachers are deploying generative AI for administrative tasks like lesson planning and rubric creation to reduce workload. The school\u0027s approach emphasizes teaching responsible AI integration through critical evaluation of AI-generated content rather than outright prohibition.",
